# Scratch copy of the benchmark tree ("cuda-ipc-benchmarks 2", 26 MB). A local
# duplicate of sources that already live in this repo, kept only for diffing
# against an older checkout. Never commit it: two divergent copies of the same
# benchmark is exactly how libmpiwrap.so went stale in three different builds.
/test/

# CloverLeaf: was a submodule pointing at upstream UoB-HPC/CloverLeaf. Dropped
# because it is out of scope for this project and the local edits could never
# be pushed there anyway (no write access to upstream). The checkout stays on
# disk with its own .git and its own history -- it is simply not part of this
# repo. Local-only: nothing here backs it up.
/CloverLeaf/
